  "notes": "National Medical Care Company ('Care'; ticker 4005) audited consolidated financial statements for the year ended 31 December 2025 with FY2024 comparatives, from the full audited PDF in the 'Annual / 2025' cell of the Saudi Exchange company-profile 'Financial Statements' tab (Resources/fsPdf/436_0_2026-02-24...). Auditor: PricewaterhouseCoopers Public Accountants. The consolidated financial statements were approved and authorised for issue by the Board of Directors on 17 February 2026 (stated on the face of the statement of financial position). Amounts are presented in full Saudi Riyals (scale 1). The four primary statements (printed FS pages 8-11) are scanned images in the filed PDF (transcribed from page renders at 2.6x); the notes are digital text. Consolidated group; equity has no non-controlling interest (equity comprises only share capital, treasury shares, a share-based-payment reserve and retained earnings), so only total_equity is carried. The FY2024 comparatives are restated - the income statement, cash-flow statement and balance sheet 'have been updated to reflect additional depreciation charge as a result of finalisation of purchase price allocation' for the acquisition of a subsidiary (Al-Salam, Note 14). intangible_assets is the combined 'Goodwill and intangible assets' line. short_term_investments is 'Term deposits'. impairment_charges is the 'Expected credit loss allowance' P&L line. other_income is 'Other operating income'; FY2024 operating profit additionally includes a SAR 42,335,866 'Reversal of charge against legal claims' one-off (no dedicated catalog field, not separately mapped). operating_income is the reported 'Operating profit'; finance_income and finance_costs are the gross 'Finance income' and 'Finance cost' lines. income_before_income_taxes_and_zakat is 'Profit before zakat'; income_taxes_and_zakat is 'Zakat (expense) reversal' - a charge of SAR 27,894,347 in FY2025 and a net credit of SAR 4,536,264 in FY2024 (a prior-year zakat reversal), so the effective-tax plausibility bound warns on FY2024 (expected). other_reserves is the 'Share based payment reserve' (nil at FY2024). long_term_debt / current_debt are the non-current 'Long-term borrowings' and its 'Current portion'. lease_liabilities_noncurrent / lease_liabilities_current are the non-current / current lease liabilities. defined_benefit_obligation is 'Employee benefit obligations'; accounts_payable is 'Trade and other payables'; zakat_payable is 'Zakat payable'. depreciation_amortization sums 'Depreciation on property and equipment', 'Amortisation of right-of-use assets' and 'Amortisation on intangibles' from the cash-flow statement. capex is 'Payments for purchase of property and equipment'; interest_paid is 'Finance cost paid'; zakat_paid is 'Zakat paid'; dividends_paid is 'Dividends paid'. The cash-flow closing balance equals the balance-sheet 'Cash and cash equivalents' line exactly. Statement page references are the printed FS page numbers: profit or loss and OCI 8, financial position 9, changes in equity 10, cash flows 11.",
